        <mxCell id="zG2_bLNGklkaXzxGd7vh-1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" value="Users: (functional spec)&lt;br&gt;Posts Messages and Acitivty(like, share, comment)&lt;br&gt;Reads News Feed&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;What is feed? (should remain abstract)&lt;br&gt;Ordered by recency - similicity&lt;br&gt;Ordered by popularity&lt;br&gt;Followed Topics&lt;br&gt;Ordered by some other analytics (follow and similar follow)&lt;br&gt;Relevant to location&lt;br&gt;Celebrity Problem? Hot Partition...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Block, Unfollow, etc?&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Estimate&lt;br&gt;10mil DAU&lt;br&gt;2mil posts/day = 1KB&lt;br&gt;Storage/day = 2GB&lt;br&gt;TPS = 2x10e9 /10e4 = 2x10e5 = 200K TPS (high) -&amp;gt;&amp;nbsp; distributed DB, Still a read heavy system&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="300" width="320" x="10" y="20" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="zG2_bLNGklkaXzxGd7vh-2" parent="1" style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;rounded=0;" value="Design -&lt;br&gt;How to injest Feed? POST v1/user/posts/{}&lt;br&gt;How to build Feed? GET v1/user/feed/{}&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Build on read* vs Build on write&lt;br&gt;- Users to User connection DB&lt;br&gt;- User ID to posts DB&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Post&lt;br&gt;User, Type, Timestamp, Tags(topics), media,&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
